# council_history.json is deliberately NOT in r2_sync PRIVATE_FILES or
# data_gate.js any more — its only writer (backfill_council_outcomes.py) is a
# manual tool, not a cron job. The ignore stays: this repo is public, so if the
# tool is ever run by hand the output must not land in a commit. Do not "fix"
# the asymmetry by re-registering it; re-register only when it has a scheduled
# writer again.
data/council_history.json
public/data/council_history.json
